{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます☾⋆ ࣪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮城県出身 21歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の山川宇衣（やまかわうい）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いま、\nあげたいブログがたくさんあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当はそちらを先に書き上げたかったのだけど…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今夜はどうしても、\nみなさんとお話ししたいなぁと思って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "取り急ぎ、\nこのブログを書き始めました😖🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもはとっても話の長いわたしですが、\n今回は短くまとめるので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんのちょっとだけ、！お付き合いください🍊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "青葉坂46オーディションの応募締切が\nいよいよ今夜の23:59に迫りました🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もしかしたら今も、大きな決断の前で"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心を決め切れずに立ち止まっているひとがいるのかなぁと思って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなとき、\nわたしにできることと言えば\nこうしてブログを書くことくらいかなぁと✉️🍊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それがどれだけ\nあなたの力になれるかは分からないけれど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんのちょっと、\nおしゃべりに付き合ってくださいな🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "決断はいつだって難しいもので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間はあればあるだけ\nその時を先延ばしにする手助けをしてくれちゃったりするし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大事に思うほど、\n先に先にって思っちゃう気持ちは\nわたしも痛いほど分かります…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（3週ぶりのVIVAN、\n大事すぎて観るの辛いとまで思った😖）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "未来なんて誰にも分からないから、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一見前向きに思える選択が必ずしもそうではなかったりもするし"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "常に後悔のない選択をすることは難しいけれど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもだからこそ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今この瞬間の心に従ってみるのも、自分の人生を生きるコツだと思う"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたの人生はあなただけのものなので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今この瞬間のあなたが\n後悔しない選択をできることを願っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このオーディションの良いところは、\n決断の時、あなたは絶対に一人じゃないってこと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここには仲間がたくさんいて\n決断の先にも、あなたを待っている人たちがいることです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（ついでにわたしも…🫢笑\n仲間に入れてほしいなぁ、こっそり待ってますね）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これを読んでいる間にも、\n大事な時間が刻一刻と過ぎ去ってしまうので…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうちょっとこのまま\nお話ししていたい気もするけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今夜はここまでで我慢する、、！\nまた話そうね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは ^ᴗ.ᴗ^ ੭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、やっぱり待って、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みてみて、流れ星！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˚‧︵‿☆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いま何願った？( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "応援してるね🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うい　#54通目"}], "source": "official"}